{"title":"*TRIP* Nov 29-Dec 6 Cancun All-Incl 4.5*","startsAt":"2026-10-16T06:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-16T08:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**Last Chance!**\n**Ladies only! 7-Night All-Inclusive 4.5\\* Cancún, Mexico**☀️\n\nCome join us **Nov 29 - Dec 6, 2026** at a gorgeous beachfront resort!\n\n**📝 Trip Details**\nFor all trip details, please click **[HERE](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdNbXmJNTdWw24AVo_jnh6weLpC_OsvqMsqcqh2q1UZRgXN0g/viewform?usp=dialog)**\nRSVP on Meetup does **not** book you on this trip.\n\n✈️ **Trip Inclusions**\n\n* 7 Nights at a 24-hour all-inclusive 4.5★ Resort\n* Direct, non-stop round-trip flights from Toronto\n* Morning flight (arriving before lunch!)\n* 1 Checked bag per person\n* 1 Carry-on bag per person\n* Round-trip airport-resort transfers\n\n**🌴Why I Can't Wait to Go Back**!\nI have personally stayed at this beautiful resort and absolutely love it! It sits on a spectacular white-sand beach with plenty of shade and loungers. Overlooking the turquoise waters are beautiful infinity pools and swim-up bars. The food is outstanding and includes a full-service buffet and five à la carte dinner restaurants.\nThe rooms are spacious and comfortable with balconies, A/C, free Wi-Fi, safe, stocked bar fridge. Plus, the location is perfect! It is within walking distance to local shopping, has a public bus right out front, and sits close to the ferry for a fun day trip to **Isla Mujeres**!\n\n🛍️ **Trip Pricing\\***\n\n* Double Occupancy: $2,175 CAD per person (incl. taxes & fees)\n* Single Occupancy: $2,735 CAD per person (incl. taxes & fees)\n* Deposit: $250 CAD per person\n\n*\\*All prices subject to change - pricing has been going up steadily every couple weeks, so booking sooner will save $$*\n\n👥 **Traveling Solo?**\nTo help you find a roommate, please feel free to use this Event’s discussion and comments area below to chat and connect with other members.\n\n📝 **Trip Details**\nFor all trip details, please click **[HERE](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdNbXmJNTdWw24AVo_jnh6weLpC_OsvqMsqcqh2q1UZRgXN0g/viewform?usp=dialog)**\nRSVP on Meetup does **not** book you on this trip.\n\nCheers!\nFawn\n\n*The Travel Agent Next Door (TTAND)*\n*1003 - 55 York St. Toronto ON M5J 1R7*\nTel: 416-367-8264 Ext. 4620\n***TICO*** *Reg. #50021282*","venue":{"name":"Toronto Pearson International Airport","address":"M9HC+WJ Mississauga, Ontario, Canada, Mississauga","lat":43.679813,"lng":-79.62844,"city":"Mississauga"},"fee":null,"group":"Shared Tables - Solo Travel Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/4/6/e/highres_534817998.jpeg"}